OL,3,AKing, Queen and Prince William to visit
OL,4,AAberfan on 60th anniversary of disaster
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe King, Queen and Prince of Wales are
OL,7,Fset to visit Aberfan later this month
OL,8,Fto mark the 60th anniversary of the
OL,9,Fdisaster which killed 116 children and
OL,10,F28 adults.
OL,12,FPantglas Junior School and surrounding
OL,13,Fhouses in the village near Merthyr
OL,14,FTydfil, south Wales, were
OL,15,Fcatastrophically engulfed in coal
OL,16,Fslurry after the colliery spoil tip
OL,17,Fcollapsed on 21 October 1966.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,311,300,200,140,0,100
