OL,3,AKing, Queen and Prince William to visit
OL,4,AAberfan on 60th anniversary of disaster
OL,5,
OL,6,FKing Charles III, Queen Camilla and
OL,7,FPrince William will join survivors,
OL,8,Fbereaved parents and members of the
OL,9,Fcommunity on the anniversary to pay
OL,10,Ftribute to those who died.
OL,12,FThe royals will visit the Aberfan
OL,13,FMemorial Garden which stands on the
OL,14,Fsite of the primary school, and go to
OL,15,Fthe Aberfan and Merthyr Vale Community
OL,16,FCentre.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
